{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00466",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 3.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a few minutes behind, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.61,
      "end_seconds": 9.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.61,
      "end_seconds": 16.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got severe pain in my right side that comes in waves."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.21,
      "end_seconds": 22.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "And when did that start? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.6,
      "end_seconds": 29.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Since last Tuesday, that's when it began. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.02,
      "end_seconds": 33.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Alright, how would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.1,
      "end_seconds": 36.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.32,
      "end_seconds": 40.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Alright, does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.62,
      "end_seconds": 56.27,
      "duration_seconds": 15.65,
      "text": "Pain moving down to the groin goes along with it, most of the time. The pain moving down to the groin? That's been for two weeks. About pain moving down to the groin, pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.83,
      "end_seconds": 60.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.96,
      "end_seconds": 72.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.44,
      "end_seconds": 77.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Have you had any vomiting, testicular pain or difficulty passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.54,
      "end_seconds": 82.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "No, no vomiting, testicular pain or difficulty passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.72,
      "end_seconds": 99.23,
      "duration_seconds": 16.51,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.72,
      "end_seconds": 102.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.74,
      "end_seconds": 107.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "So, anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.49,
      "end_seconds": 110.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "My sister has thyroid problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.14,
      "end_seconds": 114.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.26,
      "end_seconds": 121.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.99,
      "end_seconds": 129.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.87,
      "end_seconds": 133.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.74,
      "end_seconds": 137.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.46,
      "end_seconds": 140.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.51,
      "end_seconds": 142.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.8,
      "end_seconds": 143.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.89,
      "end_seconds": 148.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.5,
      "end_seconds": 150.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.76,
      "end_seconds": 169.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.24,
      "end_seconds": 172.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.81,
      "end_seconds": 176.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.03,
      "end_seconds": 193.83,
      "duration_seconds": 16.8,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.24,
      "end_seconds": 196.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.49,
      "end_seconds": 198.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.35,
      "end_seconds": 200.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.03,
      "end_seconds": 205.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.43,
      "end_seconds": 208.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "One moment, I'm updating your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.01,
      "end_seconds": 238.05,
      "duration_seconds": 17.04,
      "text": "Good, where were we. Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.46,
      "end_seconds": 242.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.38,
      "end_seconds": 249.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.58,
      "end_seconds": 260.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.19,
      "end_seconds": 265.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Putting together what you've described, it fits best with a kidney stone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.04,
      "end_seconds": 268.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.98,
      "end_seconds": 285.43,
      "duration_seconds": 16.45,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a kidney stone is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had severe pain in your right side that comes in waves, since last Tuesday, mild, and no vomiting or testicular pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.94,
      "end_seconds": 287.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.59,
      "end_seconds": 290.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.12,
      "end_seconds": 297.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.43,
      "end_seconds": 318.53,
      "duration_seconds": 20.1,
      "text": "I'm going to order kidney function tests, for renal colic. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'd like you to take diclofenac, 50 milligrams, twice a day after food, for three days. It's for stone pain. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.11,
      "end_seconds": 328.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "Drink three litres of water a day and try to strain your urine so we can catch the stone if it passes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.03,
      "end_seconds": 352.86,
      "duration_seconds": 23.83,
      "text": "Mm. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. I'd like you to see the urology team as well, and I'll write the referral. Keep an eye out, and if you get a fever or can't pass urine at all, call us the same day or go to emergency. Let's review you after the scan."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.52,
      "end_seconds": 357.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.5,
      "end_seconds": 365.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.8,
      "end_seconds": 374.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "So, I take the diclofenac, 50 milligrams, twice a day after food and come back after the scan. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.95,
      "end_seconds": 380.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.97,
      "end_seconds": 384.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}